        <infoLink name="Fearless" id="9f5c-f3e1-a5b7-9477" hidden="false" targetId="b137-13a1-eb97-c5e5" type="rule"/>
      </infoLinks>
      <rules>
        <rule name="Death Spasm" id="d34c-c282-9f6f-5b34" hidden="false">
          <description>Each time an Abomination rolls a 6 to hit in close combat you must make an additional attack. You must keep rolling until no more 6&apos;s appear. However, if the result of any of these extra attacks is a 1 then the Space Marine undergoes an uncontrolled and potentially fatal mutation, changing form and strangling all those nearby with rapidly mutating protoplasmic appendages. For every one of the extra close combat hits that roll 1 to hit, the attack will be inflicted against the Abomination&apos;s squad instead of the enemy.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
